## `apps/web/Dockerfile` (React + Vite)

```dockerfile
FROM node:20-alpine
WORKDIR /app

# copy package files first for better caching
COPY package*.json ./
COPY pnpm-lock.yaml* yarn.lock* ./

RUN npm ci --silent

COPY . /app

EXPOSE 5173
CMD ["npm", "run", "dev"]
```

---

## `apps/api/composer.json` — trechos importantes

> Acrescenta as `repositories` e `autoload` abaixo no `composer.json` do `apps/api`.

```json
"repositories": [
  { "type": "path", "url": "../../packages/domain", "options": { "symlink": true } },
  { "type": "path", "url": "../../packages/shared", "options": { "symlink": true } },
  { "type": "path", "url": "../../packages/contracts", "options": { "symlink": true } }
],
"autoload": {
  "psr-4": {
    "App\\": "app/",
    "WorkLedger\\Domain\\": "../../packages/domain/src/",
    "WorkLedger\\Shared\\": "../../packages/shared/src/",
    "WorkLedger\\Contracts\\": "../../packages/contracts/src/"
  }
}
```

Depois de adicionar, executa dentro de `apps/api`:

```bash
composer update
composer dump-autoload
```

